Image Arithmetic Operations in OpenCV

Image arithmetic means performing mathematical operations between images or between an image and a constant value.

Common operations:

Image Addition
Image Subtraction
Image Multiplication
Image Division

1. Image Addition
      Used to combine two images or increase brightness.

2. Image Subtraction
      Used to find differences between two images.

3. Image Multiplication
     Used to increase brightness or apply masks.

4. Image Division
      Used for normalization and image enhancement.
